# Go files are gofmt-normalized with LF. Without this, core.autocrlf checks them
# out as CRLF on Windows and `gofmt -l .` reports every one as unformatted even
# though the stored content is clean.
*.go text eol=lf

# The stylesheet is parsed as text by frontend/src/ui/styles.test.ts, and the
# frontend sources are read the same way. Without this, core.autocrlf checks
# them out as CRLF on Windows and that parser aborts before a single assertion
# runs -- 18 stylesheet guarantees vanish from a fresh clone.
*.css text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
